  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gaza health emergency response through supporting life-saving essential health services and public health intelligence and services</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective is: maintained functionality of existing health facilities to deliver health services to the population of Gaza to reduce indirect mortality and morbidity during the current escalations of hostilities and in the immediate aftermath.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
